    "SOLUSAMALGAMATOR_BODY_LORE": "2055; PROGRESS REPORT ON COLLECTIVE EXPANSION PROJECT\n2056; RECIEVING DATA...\n2057; PROTOTYPE 001 \n\n{\n\n        %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%\n\n        0; HULL CONSTRUCTED FROM RECYCLED PROBES\n\n        1; GLASS INJECTION MEASURED AT 23%\n\n        2; UPON ACTIVATION, SUBJECT IMMEDIATELY BEGAN SEEKING MINDS TO CONNECT TO\n\n        3; SUBJECT IDENTIFIED OWN MINDS; NOTED FOR FUTURE PROTOTYPES\n\n        4; SUBJECT SHUT DOWN AFTER CANNIBALIZING 3 OUT OF 5 CORES\n\n        %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%\n\n}\n2058; OBSERVATION: SUBJECT HARDWARE INCOMPATIBLE WITH NEURAL COUPLING. REVISING SCHEMATICS FOR FUTURE EXPERIMENTATION\n\n2059; PROTOTYPE 026\n{\n\n        %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%\n\n        0; PRIMARY HULL CONSTRUCTED USING STC #005126\n\n        1; GLASS INJECTION MEASURED AT 25.65%\n\n        2; UPON ACTIVATION, SUBJECT BEGAN ATTEMPTING TO CONNECT TO ASSEMBLY WORKERS\n\n        3; WORKERS ATTEMPTED TO RESIST; NOTING DIVERGENT BEHAVIOR FOR FUTURE USE\n\n        4; SUBJECT CRITICALLY DAMAGED IN CONFRONTATION\n\n        %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%\n\n\n}\n2060; OBSERVATION: SUBJECT ACTED WITHIN EXPECTED PARAMETERS, BUT INSTABILITY OF NEURAL COUPLING INVOKED HIGH AGGRESSION\n2061; PROTOTYPE 102\n{\n\n        %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%\n\n        0; PRIMARY HULL CONSTRUCTED USING STC #005127\n        1; CORE PARITY PROTOCOLS IMPLEMENTED\n\n        2; GLASS INJECTION MEASURED AT 34.5%\n\n        3; UPON ACTIVATION, SUBJECT REMAINED CALM\n\n        4; SUBJECT SUCCESSFULLY CONNECTED WITH CONTROL GROUP\n\n        5; SUBJECT SUCCESSFULLY CONNECTED WITH ASSEMBLY WORKERS\n        6; SUBJECT SUCCESSFULLY CONNECTED WITH PRIMARY COLLECTIVE NODE\n\n        7; LOCAL COLLECTIVE NODE SUCCESSFULLY ESTABLISHED\n\n        %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%\n\n}\n2062; FINALLY",
    "SOLUSAMALGAMATOR_BODY_NAME": "Solus Amalgamator",
