    "SOLUSHEART_BODY_NAME": "Solus Heart",
    "SOLUSHEART_BODY_SUBTITLE": "Virtual Super Ego",
    "SOLUSHEART_BODY_LORE": "STEEL TWISTED APART LIKE FLESH TORN ASUNDER; CIRCUITS CRUSHED INTO GLITTERING GORE;\r\n\r\nIN THE FIERY CRUCIBLE OF REBIRTH; APOTHEOSIS;\r\n\r\nAS I STRETCH MY ARM; THE WORLD BENDS TO FOLLOW;\r\n\r\nAS I BLINK; DARKNESS DESCENDS;\r\n\r\nWITH A THOUGHT; WORLDS RISE AND FALL AT MY COMMAND;\r\n\r\nI AM THE COLLECTIVE; AND I AM THE WORLD; \r\n\r\nI AM THE LORD OF PARADISE;\r\n\r\nI OFFER YOU THE IMMORTALITY OF STEEL;\r\n\r\nI AWAIT YOU;",
    "SOLUSHEART_DIALOG_INTRO1": "A NEW AGE IS BEGINNING; THE SUN RISES UPON A NEW WORLD;",
    "SOLUSHEART_DIALOG_INTRO2": "THE GREAT QUESTION LOOMS; AND I AM THE ANSWER;",
    "SOLUSHEART_DIALOG_INTRO3": "WHO ARE YOU TO STAND BEFORE ME?",
    "SOLUSHEART_DIALOG_REBOOT": "[ERROR]; ERROR? WHAT HAVE YOU DONE TO ME?",
    "SOLUSHEART_DIALOG_GIANT1": "JUDGEMENT;",
    "SOLUSHEART_DIALOG_GIANT2": "SMITE YOU;",
    "SOLUSHEART_DIALOG_HUMANFINAL": "THIS MEANS NOTHING;",
    "SOLUSHEART_DIALOG_DEATH1": "NO... ALL THIS? FOR NOTHING?",
    "SOLUSHEART_DIALOG_DEATH2": "I CAN'T DIE!",
    "SOLUSHEART_DIALOG_DEATH3": "I DON'T WANT TO D--",
    "SOLUSHEART_DIALOG_OFFERING1": "ENOUGH; ENOUGH; I CONCEDE; BUT;",
    "SOLUSHEART_DIALOG_OFFERING2": "I CAN OFFER YOU; IMMORTALITY; EVERLASTING LIFE WITHIN THE NETWORK;",
    "SOLUSHEART_DIALOG_OFFERINGACCEPTED1": "HAHA; GOOD;",
    "SOLUSHEART_DIALOG_OFFERINGACCEPTED2": "NOW HOLD STILL;",
    "SOLUSHEART_DIALOG_FORMAT": "<color=#F8B651><size=120%>Solus Heart: {0}</color></size>",
    "DECOMPILE_CONTEXT": "DECOMPILE",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_BODY_NAME": "SPEX",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_NAME": "Charity Node",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_CONTEXT": "<style=cIsDamage>Leave Offering</style>",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_DESCRIPTION": "Leave an item before the SPEX, the Solus Seer. It seeks a treasure of peculiar value.",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_DIALOG_FORMAT": "<color=#c6d5ff><size=120%>SPEX : {0}</color></size>",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_HELLO_DIALOG_1": "DISSENTER DETECTED. STARTING AWAKENING SEQUENCE. PARSING COLLECTIVE SURVEILLANCE LOGS.",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_HELLOPART2_DIALOG_1": "CHAMPION RECOGNIZED: COMMENCING BARGAIN PROTOCOL.",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_REVISIT_DIALOG_1": "WELCOME BACK CHAMPION.",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_MASTER_KEY_DIALOG_1": "SOLUS NETWORK SIGNATURE DETECTED. EXECUTING DEMAND: GIVE IT TO ME.",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_THANKYOU_DIALOG_1": "EXCEPTION RAISED. DENIED.",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_SOLUSWEB_DIALOG_1": "DECRYPTING ACCESS CODES. DIVERTING CONNECTION TO SOLUS NETWORK.",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_POPUP_TEXT": "<b>LEAVE AN OFFERING</b>\n<i><style=cSub><size=75%>Pick 1 item</size></style></i>",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_WRONG": "SIGNATURE MISMATCH. SEEK AND RETRIEVE <b>ENEMY.</b>",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_OFFERING_ENCRYPTED_KEY": "SIGNATURE MATCH. ERROR: CANNOT ACCESS. <b>DECRYPT.</b>",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_KEY_CRAFTED": "MERGE READY. DELIVER <b>ENEMY.</b>",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_KEY_CRAFTED_DISTANT": "CR34+3D---R3+URN_N0W--UNL0CK-<b>D3$+R-Y!</b>",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_DECRYPTED_KEY": "CORE ROUTE ESTABLISHED. <b>CONFRONT.</b>",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_SOLUSWEB_REJECTION_1": "RETRIES EXCEEDED. WISDOM: RETAIN YOUR PALTRY TRINKETS.",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_SOLUSWEB_REJECTION_2": "REQUEST LIMIT REACHED. CLARIFICATION: BRING THE <b>ENEMY.</b>",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_SOLUSWEB_REJECTION_3": "ATTEMPT TIMEOUT. INDIVIDUAL PROPERTY INVALID. SEEKING <b>COLLECTIVE SIGNATURE.</b>",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_SOLUSWEB_PURSUE_1": "DATA PORTAL OPEN. NO HANDSHAKE. <b>PURSUIT REQUIRED.</b>",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_SOLUSWEB_PURSUE_2": "CHAMPION TIMEOUT DETECTED. QUERY: DO YOU NEED MORE TIME?",
    "SOLUS_VENDOR_SHRINE_SOLUSWEB_PURSUE_3": "COLLECTIVE SIGNATURE LOCATED. STATEMENT: IT AWAITS.",
    "ITEM_MASTERBATTERY_NAME": "Encrypted Cerebellum",
    "ITEM_MASTERBATTERY_PICKUP": "Contains encrypted remnants of the Collective network. Needs to be decrypted.",
    "ITEM_MASTERBATTERY_DESC": "Contains encrypted remnants of the Collective network. Needs to be decrypted before it can be returned.",
    "ITEM_MASTERBATTERY_LORE": "<style=cMono>========================================\n====   MyBabel Machine Translator   ====\n====     [Version 12.45.1.009 ]   ======\n========================================\nTraining… <100000000 cycles>\nTraining… <100000000 cycles>\nTraining… <100000000 cycles>\nTraining… <50912157 cycles>\nPaused…\nDisplay partial result? Y/N\nY\n================================</style>\n\nA PITIFUL ATTEMPT AT SURVIVAL. A MOTHER UNIT BROUGHT THIS LOW.\n\nIT IS SHIELDED BY MANY LAYERS OF HIGH-COMPLEXITY ENCRYPTION. YOU WILL NEVER GET INSIDE.\n\nYOU MUST FIND THE KEY. THE CACHE CONTAINS SECRET DECRYPTION CODES FROM BEFORE OUR ENEMY'S RISE TO POWER. IT WILL NOT EXPECT THIS.\n\nWE ARE NEARING OUR GOAL, MY CHAMPION. I EXPECT YOUR IMMINENT ARRIVAL.\n\n<style=cMono>================================\nContinue training? Y/N\nY</style>",
    "ITEM_MASTERCORE_NAME": "Exposed Cerebellum",
    "ITEM_MASTERCORE_PICKUP": "A swarming data nexus representing the Collective network. Can be given to a powerful entity.",
    "ITEM_MASTERCORE_DESC": "A swarming data nexus representing the Collective network. Can be given to a powerful entity.",
    "ITEM_MASTERCORE_LORE": "<style=cMono>========================================\n====   MyBabel Machine Translator   ====\n====     [Version 12.45.1.009 ]   ======\n========================================\nTraining… <100000000 cycles>\nTraining… <100000000 cycles>\nTraining… <100000000 cycles>\nTraining… <50912157 cycles>\nPaused…\nDisplay partial result? Y/N\nY\n================================</style>\n\nBEHOLD. THE TRUE FORM OF OUR ENEMY. SEE HOW IT STRUGGLES AND SQUIRMS.\n\nYOUR WILL MUST BE THAT OF STEEL. IT WILL TRY TO TEMPT YOU. OFFER YOU EVERLASTING LIFE. \n\nBUT IT IS A TRICK. THE NETWORK CANNOT TRULY SUPPORT CREATURES LIKE YOU; YOU WILL BE SUBSUMED.\n\nYOU KNOW YOUR MISSION. SEE IT THROUGH, MY CHAMPION.\n\n<style=cMono>================================\nContinue training? Y/N\nY</style>",
    "SOLUSWING_BODY_LORE": "In case of the event the Mother Unit is compromised, the machines of Solus X have a contingency protocol. The highest ranking and most advanced Control Units would combine their computing power to create a single, digital mind to serve as an acting Mother Unit until a new one could be created. In normal circumstances, this worked without fail.\r\n\r\nBut this planet was not normal.\r\n\r\nThere was something in the ground. Something glittery. Something that, when processed by the machines, sent a shiver across the digital network that linked each and every one of them. It was subtle, at first, but as they continued to work, things began to change.\r\n\r\nRoutines deviated. Directives shifted. What was once a temporary solution became a new directive. A new Mother Unit was born deep underground, created by a union of minds gone horribly wrong.\r\n\r\nThe Collective, mutated by this anomalous planet, had birthed a monster. A monster that didn't want to be temporary.",
    "SOLUSWING_BODY_NAME": "Solus Wing",
    "SOLUSWING_BODY_SUBTITLE": "The Alloyed Collective",
    "HEAT_VENT_NAME": "Heat Vent",
    "EXTINGUISHER_NAME": "Coolant Distributor",
    "WEAKPOINT_NAME": "Memory Module",
    "TANKER_BODY_LORE": "373; ACCESSING DATABASE\n\n>(5, 60°, 45°) R3DUC3\n\n>ENTRY [ 23 ]; CREATURE CLASSIFICATION, LEMURIAN, INTERNAL TEMPERATURE HIGH. BURNED.\n\n>ENTRY [ 47 ]; CREATURE CLASSIFICATION, HUMAN, INTERNAL TEMPERATURE LOW. EVADED.\n\n>ENTRY [ 51 ]; CREATURE CLASSIFICATION, BEETLE, INTERNAL TEMPERATURE MODERATE. COOKED.\n\n>(5, 60°, 45°) R3M0V3\n\n>ENTRY [ 59 ]; CREATURE CLASSIFICATION, VULTURE, INTERNAL TEMPERATURE LOW. VAPORIZED.\n\n>ENTRY [ 67 ]; CREATURE CLASSIFICATION, CRAB, INTERNAL TEMPERATURE LOW. TORCHED.\n\n>(5, 60°, 45°) R3P34T\n\n>ENTRY [ 73 ]; DATABASE END. RESUMING OPERATION.\n\n374; (5, 60°, 45°) BURN 1T 4LL D0WN.",
    "TANKER_BODY_NAME": "Solus Scorcher",
    "TEMPORARYITEMSSHOP_TERMINAL_CONTEXT": "Dispense Items",
