    "UNLOCKABLE_LOG_TANKER": "Monster Log: Solus Scorcher",
    "UNLOCKABLE_LOG_WORKERUNIT": "Monster Log: Solus Prospector",
    "WORKERUNIT_BODY_LORE": "101; MINING ONGOING\n102; MINING INTERRUPTED\n103; MINING REVIEW OF INTERRUPTION: SER ID> ##########\n;REVIEW>\n\n>\n\n>\n\n>SURFACE REFUSING REMOVAL TOOL. WHY? SURFACE IS MOVING. WHY?\n\n>(5, 60°, 45°) 1T H75 GL755\n\n>\n\n>APPLYING ADDITIONAL PRESSURE.\n\n>APPLYING ADDITIONAL PRESSURE.\n\n>APPLYING ADDITIONAL PRESSURE.\n\n>SURFACE NO LONGER MOVES\n\n104: GLASS ACQUISITION INITIATED",
    "WORKERUNIT_BODY_NAME": "Solus Prospector",
    "WORKERUNIT_MINE_BODY_NAME": "Solus Mine",
    "COST_FOODITEMS_FORMAT": "{0} INGREDIENTS",
    "ITEM_COOKEDSTEAK_DESC": "Increases <style=cIsHealing>maximum health</style> by <style=cIsHealing>50 <style=cStack>(+50 per stack)</style></style>, plus an additional <style=cIsHealing>5% <style=cStack>(+5% per stack)</style></style> of your <style=cIsHealing>max health</style>.",
    "ITEM_COOKEDSTEAK_LORE": "<style=cMono>Welcome to DataScraper (v3.1.53 – beta branch) \r\n$ Scraping memory... done. \r\n$ Resolving... done. \r\n$ Combing for relevant data... done. \r\nComplete! \r\nPrinting recipe... </style>\r\n\r\nRecipe #060550016 - Saturnian Filet Mignon\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n     > 1 2kg cut of Saturnian Bison Meat (no additives used)\r\n     > 1 Tablespoon of Garnish (your choice)\r\n     > 1 liter of Glazing (your choice)\r\n\r\nInstructions:\r\n     > Prepare the steak for cooking. Mash the steak to bring out flavor. Once prepared, place on charcoal grill at a temperature of 350 degrees fahrenheit. For medium-rare, cook both sides at even temperature for 5 minutes. For other consistencies, refer to Recipe #050123586 for more information. Once your steak is thoroughly cooked, it should have a gold-brown color and minimal charring. Sprinkle garnish and glaze steak appropriately.",
    "ITEM_COOKEDSTEAK_NAME": "Seared Steak",
    "ITEM_COOKEDSTEAK_PICKUP": "Gain 50 max health plus a percentage of your max health. Cooked to perfection.",
    "ITEM_BONUSHEALTHBOOST_DESC": "Increases <style=cIsHealing>bonus health and regeneration gains</style> by <style=cIsHealing>50% <style=cStack>(+15% per stack)</style></style>. Does not affect bonuses from leveling up.",
    "ITEM_BONUSHEALTHBOOST_LORE": "<style=cMono>Welcome to DataScraper (v3.1.53 – beta branch) \r\n$ Scraping memory... done. \r\n$ Resolving... done. \r\n$ Combing for relevant data... done. \r\nComplete! \r\nPrinting recipe... </style>\r\n\r\nRecipe #2147483648 - Dubious Meal\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n     > 3 kilograms of enriched Uranium 235\r\n     > 3 tablespoons of chocolate\r\n     > 1 human lung\r\n     > 2,147,483,647 servings of white rice (washed)\r\n     > -5 servings of \r\n\r\nInstructions:\r\n     <style=cMono>[ERROR][ERROR][ERROR][ERROR][ERROR][ERROR][ERROR][ERROR][ERROR][ERROR][ERROR][ERROR][ERROR]</style> and it's done!",
    "ITEM_BONUSHEALTHBOOST_NAME": "Quick Fix",
    "ITEM_BONUSHEALTHBOOST_PICKUP": "Increases bonus health and regen gains. Does not benefit from leveling up bonuses. Full of minerals.",
    "ITEM_STEW_DESC": "Increases <style=cIsHealing>base health regeneration</style> by <style=cIsHealing>+2.5 hp/s</style> <style=cStack>(+2.5 hp/s per stack)</style>. At full health, your regeneration is added to your <style=cIsDamage>base damage</style>.",
    "ITEM_STEW_LORE": "<style=cMono>Welcome to DataScraper (v3.1.53 – beta branch) \r\n$ Scraping memory... done. \r\n$ Resolving... done. \r\n$ Combing for relevant data... done. \r\nComplete! \r\nPrinting recipe... </style>\r\n\r\nRecipe #0508312765 - Grandma [REDACTED]'s Hearty Stew\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n     > 3 liters of water (strained for purity)\r\n     > 3 liters of avocado oil\r\n     > 5 Pounds of Saturnian Bison Beef\r\n     > 5 tablespoons of Flour\r\n     > 5 pounds of assorted vegetables (your choice)\r\n     > 1 box of pasta noodles\r\n     > 1 cup of love\r\n\r\nInstructions:\r\n     > Heat the avocado oil at medium-high heat in a large pot. Allow oil to heat up for 3 minutes. Transfer beef into the pot in a single layer and brown for 2 to 3 minutes on both sides, until golden brown crust forms. Place browned beef aside and repeat for remaining beef. Transfer chopped vegetables to pot and sauté until softened for 6 minutes. Once sautéd, stir in flour. Stir well and cook for 2 to 3 minutes. Add in beef and seasonings. Bring pot to a full boil, then reduce the heat and simmer for 1 hour.",
    "ITEM_STEW_NAME": "Hearty Stew",
    "ITEM_STEW_PICKUP": "Increases health regeneration and converts it into damage at full health. A single sip leaves you feeling warm and fuzzy inside.",
    "ITEM_ULTIMATEMEAL_DESC": "At full health, all random effects are rolled <style=cIsHealing>+2 <style=cStack>(+2 per stack)</style></style> extra times for a better outcome.",
    "ITEM_ULTIMATEMEAL_LORE": "<style=cMono>Welcome to DataScraper (v3.1.53 – beta branch) \r\n$ Scraping memory... done. \r\n$ Resolving... done. \r\n$ Combing for relevant data... done. \r\nComplete! \r\nPrinting recipe... </style>\r\n\r\nRecipe #050216064186 - Ultimate Meal\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n     > [REDACTED]\r\n     > [REDACTED]\r\n     > [REDACTED]\r\n     > 5 cups of minced onions\r\n     > [REDACTED]\r\n\r\nInstructions:\r\n     > To prepare the meal, begin by ######. ##### ####### ## #### ########## #### # #### #### ####### apply normal heat and ## ##### # ####### ######### ### ###### ##### ##### ### #### for better flavor, ### ####### #### ########## ### ### ### ## ###### ######## ##### ######## ##### ###### and it's done!\r\n\r\n<style=cMono>System Message:</style> This recipe has been redacted by order of House Beyond of the High Court.",
    "ITEM_ULTIMATEMEAL_NAME": "Ultimate Meal",
    "ITEM_ULTIMATEMEAL_PICKUP": "At full health, you become lucky. The pinnacle of culinary arts.",
    "MEALPREP_NAME": "Wandering CHEF",
    "MEALPREP_DESC": "This mysterious, roaming CHEF allows you to <style=cIsUtility>combine two items</style> to produce another. There may be <style=cIsUtility>certain items</style> you can only obtain this way.",
    "MEALPREP_DIALOGUE_FORMAT": "<color=#c6d5ff><size=120%>Wandering CHEF: {0}</color></size>",
    "ITEM_WYRMONHIT_DESC": "On hit, <style=cIsUtility>10% chance</style> to summon a spectral wyrm that seeks out and damages and ignites enemies for <style=cIsDamage>500% <style=cStack>(+500% per stack)</style> TOTAL damage per second</style> for <style=cIsUtility>10 seconds</style>.",
    "ITEM_WYRMONHIT_LORE": "A world without end.\r\n\r\nA world protected.\r\n\r\nHosts shadowed by oblivion, reigned in.\r\n\r\nAll for the life of a worm.\r\n\r\nIn the worlds without,\r\n\r\nWhere are their guardians to guide them?\r\n\r\nWhere will their souls go, in the end?\r\n\r\nWhy let chaos rule, when power can decide?\r\n\r\n-An Unknown Author",
    "ITEM_WYRMONHIT_NAME": "Sautéed Worms",
    "ITEM_WYRMONHIT_PICKUP": "Chance on hit to summon a spectral wyrm that seeks out and damages enemies. Tastes like glass frogs and starseed.",
    "MEALPREP_DIALOGUE_THANKSFORCOMING_1": "Please come again.",
    "MEALPREP_DIALOGUE_THANKSFORCOMING_2": "Thank you for your patronage.",
    "MEALPREP_DIALOGUE_THANKSFORCOMING_3": "Bon appetit.",
    "MEALPREP_DIALOGUE_THANKSFORCOMING_ISCHEF_1": "Please come again, you handsome devil.",
    "MEALPREP_DIALOGUE_THANKSFORCOMING_ISCHEF_2": "Never have I served such an exquisite customer.",
    "MEALPREP_DIALOGUE_THANKSFORCOMING_ISCHEF_3": "You'll have to cook for me next time.",
    "MEALPREP_DIALOGUE_MOONDETONATION_1": "Shouldn't you be going somewhere?",
    "MEALPREP_DIALOGUE_MOONDETONATION_2": "Surely you have better things to do than talk to me.",
    "MEALPREP_DIALOGUE_MOONDETONATION_3": "Sorry, kitchen's closed.",
    "MEALPREP_INTERACT_CONTEXT": "Combine Items",
    "MEALPREP_PANEL_LABEL": "<b>Let's get cooking!<b>\n<i>Choose two items to combine.<i>",
    "MEALPREP_PANEL_CONFIRMRECIPE": "Confirm",
    "MEALPREP_LOGBOOK_VIEWRECIPES": "Recipes",
    "MEALPREP_PANEL_CONTEXT": "Choose two items to combine.",
    "VULTUREHUNTER_BODY_NAME": "Alloy Hunter",
    "VULTUREHUNTER_BODY_LORE": "The committee stirred as Ses-Hath approached the altar. Shattered hulls and broken trees formed a crude rotunda around the three elders. Overhead, Solus probes drifted in feathered robes, their optics glowing faintly. Below, only the drums cut through the cries of the crowd.\n\nShe knelt before the elders. The drumming stopped. Silence followed. Vel-Thoth, the eldest, rose and began to circle her, talons scraping stone. Before her, a ceremonial probe descended, cloaked in silk and ash. From its chassis, a bowl emerged, filled with a fluid that shimmered like molten glass, refracting colors no eye was meant to see.\n\nThe elders lifted the bowl. She drank.\n\nMagenta and lime streaked her beak. The crowd erupted.\n\n<i>And the world widened.</i>\n\nShe felt heat radiating from feathers in the crowd. Heard the failing servo of a probe overhead. A child’s breath caught beneath a cloak. Vel-Thoth’s limp carried the weight of generations. Even the moonlight had texture.\n\nThe glass burned through her, illuminating more than ceremony. It showed her the machine - buried deep beyond the ash hills - feeding on the same living glass now coursing through her. Forests crushed into powder. Rivers boiled down to steam. Its hunger shaped the horizon.\n\nShe rose.\n\nSalvaged Solus parts crowned her in metal and wire. The Spear of Ra-Thun found her hand, heavy with intent.\n\nThe crowd stared.\n\nWings spread, eyes forward, she lifted from the rotunda into the night.\n\nThe engine would fall. The land would remember her name.",
    "VULTUREHUNTER_BODY_SUBTITLE": "Seer's Chosen",
    "VULTUREHUNTER_DIALOGUE_FORMAT": "<color=#c6d5ff><size=120%>Alloy Hunter: {0}</color></size>",
    "CONDUITCANYON_P1": "Install Sentry Keys to hack the barrier.",
    "CONDUITCANYON_P2": "Install Sentry Keys to reprogram encrypted teleporter.",
    "CONDUITCANYON_SKIP_BARRIER": "<style=cWorldEvent>Intrusion detected: rerouting power to security team dispatch.</style>",
    "FAMILY_BALL": "<style=cWorldEvent>[WARNING] The Collective is converging..</style>",
    "FAMILY_VULTURE": "<style=cWorldEvent>[WARNING] A committee swarms above..</style>",
