    "HALLOWEDCAULDRON_INSPECT": "Choose between Life and Death. Choosing the Hand of Life transmutes Hexes into a choice of items, with the rarity and number scaling with the amount of Hexes offered. Choosing the Hand of Death grants more Hexes to strengthen your reward later on.",
