    "BROTHER_REVIVE_4": "Back for the slaughter.",
    "BROTHER_SPAWN_PHASE1_MAXKARMA_1": "Die, like the planet you ravaged.",
    "BROTHER_SPAWN_PHASE1_MAXKARMA_2": "You would prepare my home for my return, yet stand in my way at the final hour?",
