    "BROTHER_SPAWN_PHASE1_MAXKARMA_HERETIC": "Trying to return to my good graces, Heretic? Die again in disgrace.",
    "BROTHER_SPAWN_PHASE1_MAXKARMA_FALSESON": "Throwing away his entire legacy over a childish tantrum? You really are just like him.",
