    "RULE_KARMASLIDER_8_DESC": "The run begins with 8 Karma earned.",
    "RULE_KARMAMULTIPLIER_NAME": "Karma Modifier",
    "RULE_KARMAMODIFIER_X1_DESC": "Certain milestones in your run award a normal amount of Karma.",
    "RULE_KARMAMODIFIER_X2_DESC": "Certain milestones in your run award twice as much Karma.",
    "RULE_KARMAMODIFIER_X3_DESC": "Certain milestones in your run award three times as much Karma.",
    "WAKE_POTENTIAL_PICKUP_NAME": "Waking Essence",
    "WAKE_POTENTIAL_PICKUP_DESCRIPTION": "An essence from the Wake that allows you to pick an Item at your leisure.",
    "WAKE_POTENTIAL_PICKUP_LORE": "N/A",
    "WAKE_POTENTIAL_PICKUP_PROMPT": "Discover Boon.",
    "WAKE_POTENTIAL_INTERACTION_HEADER": "Retrieve your Boon...",
    "ULTIMA_POTENTIAL_PICKUP_NAME": "Echoing Essence",
    "ULTIMA_POTENTIAL_PICKUP_DESCRIPTION": "A waning essence that allows you to pick two Items at your leisure.",
    "ULTIMA_POTENTIAL_PICKUP_LORE": "N/A",
    "ULTIMA_POTENTIAL_PICKUP_PROMPT": "Discover Boon.",
    "ULTIMA_POTENTIAL_INTERACTION_HEADER": "Retrieve your Boon...",
    "ITEM_HEXHAUNTING_NAME": "Hex of Haunting",
    "ITEM_HEXHAUNTING_PICKUP": "Some interactables are <style=cDeath>haunted</style>.",
    "ITEM_HEXHAUNTING_DESC": "Summons a <style=cDeath>Poltergeist</style> every <style=cIsUtility>60</style> seconds <style=cStack>(-25% per stack)</style> that haunts an <style=cIsUtility>interactable</style>. Haunted interactables float and get thrown towards you, dealing damage.",
    "ITEM_HEXHAUNTING_LORE": "CONCLUSION 61\n\nThe N’tormat hypothesis is rejected. No evidence supports the existence of the deity described therein.\n\nHowever: Terminal biological events produce reproducible occlusion of a nonlocal phenomenon possessing no detectable origin with Zones 1-5. Said phenomenon reacts independently of distance, mass, and intervening material. Variance between trials cannot presently be attributed to stochastic error; evidence is insufficient to determine whether said variance constitutes response.\n\nWorking designation remains “WESHAN”.\n\nCorrelation with Heaven remains unresolved.\n\nHouse Within requests authorization for the requisition of any fourteen subjects for Trial 62.\n\n",
    "ITEM_MIMICRY_NAME": "Hex of Mimicry",
    "ITEM_MIMICRY_PICKUP": "Chests are <style=cDeath>not always as they seem</style>.",
    "ITEM_MIMICRY_DESC": "Summons a <style=cDeath>Mimic</style> every <style=cIsUtility>60</style> seconds <style=cStack>(-10% per stack)</style>. The Mimic gains a <style=cIsUtility>0%</style> increase to <style=cIsUtility>ALL stats</style> <style=cStack>(+10% per stack)</style>.",
    "ITEM_MIMICRY_LORE": "<style=cMono>//–AUTO-TRANSCRIPTION FROM UES [REDACTED]–//</style>\n\nELENI: You can’t light those in here.\nHANAN: They’re ceremonial candles.\nELENI: That isn't any better.\n[Hanan places unidentified skull atop Security Chest #HR-1138]\nELENI: Is that company property?\nHANAN: The chest?\nELENI: The skull.\nHANAN: No.\nELENI: Okay.\nHANAN: [TRANSCRIPTION FAILED] [14 seconds of indecipherable chanting]\nELENI: What’s this supposed to do?\nHANAN: Cargo keeps disappearing. Management calls it shrinkage.\nELENI: So you’re performing a ritual… to reduce shrinkage?\nHANAN: I’m improving asset retention.\n[Security Chest #HR-1138 begins shaking. #HR-1139 follows.]\nELENI: Is that supposed to happen?\nHANAN: Nope.\n[Additional security chests begin shaking.]\nELENI: Turn it off??\nHANAN: It’s not a machine.\nELENI: THEN UNDO IT??\n[TRANSCRIPTION TERMINATED]\n\n<style=cSub>INCIDENT RESOLUTION: Employees ELENI and HANAN terminated. One security camera and three fire extinguishers damaged; unidentified skull unrecovered. No cargo was lost or damaged.\n\nADDENDUM: Cargo Bay 6 of UES [REDACTED] reports an 11% improvement in asset retention following incident. Recommendation to discontinue ritual practices remains pending review.</style>"
  },
